  "description": "This library provides SPC (Script Packet Communication) mode communication with Micro-Sensys RFID readers. \nIt will handle the communication using the standard format, and will automatically decode the Heartbeat information. Furthermore send (if supported by script) and receive of data commands is supported.\nIt is possible to call blocking functions, async functions and run the functions in separate threads.\n\nUsed Type:\niIDReaderLibrary.SpcInterfaceControl",
